        "id": 17476,
        "title": "Filtrar valores",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148342,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Digamos que queremos encontrar ciertos objetos de juego que cumplan con una condición especificada y extraerlos en un nuevo array.</p><p>Una forma de hacer esto es a través de un bucle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  dangerousEnemies.push(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148343,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En su lugar, podemos usar la función <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> crea un nuevo array con valores que satisfacen una condición.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> utiliza la sintaxis: <code>ArrayName.filter()</code>. Vamos a llamarlo en el array <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".map()\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemies</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y luego <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148344,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para indicar a la función <code>.filter()</code> si debe incluir o excluir un valor en el nuevo array, necesitamos pasar una función como parámetro.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>function</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148345,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Necesitamos darle a la función inline acceso a los elementos del array.</p><p>Para hacerlo, simplemente añadimos un parámetro a la función. En este caso, usaremos <code>element</code>, pero cualquier nombre funciona.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"126\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elixir&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helmet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Arrow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sItems = inventory.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;S&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sItems);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148346,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para indicar a la función <code>.filter()</code> qué valores almacenar en el nuevo array, la declaración <code>return</code> de la función debe devolver un booleano.</p><p>Normalmente escribimos una condicional que involucra el elemento del array o el índice que resulta en un valor booleano.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"arr\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"123\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code> seguido de <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si incluimos un segundo parámetro en la función <code>filter()</code>, podemos acceder al índice de cada iteración junto con el valor del array.</p><p>En este ejemplo, llamaremos al parámetro <code>index</code>, pero se puede usar cualquier nombre.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"145\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTiles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Exit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Void&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playableTiles = levelTiles.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (index &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playableTiles);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para simplificar nuestra sintaxis, podemos incorporar una función flecha de JavaScript en lugar de la función inline.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code> seguido de <code>=&gt;</code> y finalmente <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué función de JavaScript podemos usar para crear un nuevo array de elementos que satisfacen una condición?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué debemos pasar como parámetro para indicar a la función <code>.filter()</code> qué valores incluir en el nuevo array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo una declaración condicional</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una función.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148351,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo podemos pasar los valores del array a la función inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Al agregar un parámetro a la función inline</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Al agregar el segundo parámetro obligatorio a la función inline</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Al agregar un parámetro a la función inline.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148352,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué podemos acceder al incluir un segundo parámetro en la función inline de <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El índice actual en la iteración</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El array de llamada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El índice actual en la iteración.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo de valor devuelve la función inline de <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un booleano</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una cadena</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un booleano.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué podríamos usar una función flecha en lugar de una función inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque una función flecha simplifica la sintaxis</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque una función flecha no necesita parámetros</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque una función flecha simplifica la sintaxis.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función <code>.filter()</code> en el array <code>loot</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Torch&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Trap&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tunic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = loot.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>loot</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y finalmente <code>filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega una función inline dentro de la función <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hitPoints = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tankyEnemies = hitPoints.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>function</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega el parámetro apropiado para darle a la función inline acceso a los valores del array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damageValues = [\" /><text value=\"19.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lightHits = damageValues.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage &lt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lightHits);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código la palabra clave correcta para que la función <code>.filter()</code> llene el array <code>safeZones</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" collisionDamage = [\" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"77\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"82\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"93\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" safeZones = collisionDamage.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"dmg\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dmg &gt; \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(safeZones);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código los parámetros en el orden correcto para que <code>first3</code> almacene los primeros tres <code>highScores</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScores = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sara&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = highScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"player, rank\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>player</code> seguido de <code>,</code> y finalmente <code>rank</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 148360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica una función flecha que devuelva <code>true</code> si el índice del elemento es menor que 3.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScores = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sara&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" highScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"player, rank\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(player, rank)</code> seguido de <code>=&gt;</code> y luego <code>rank</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
